Helm Commands:
--------------

🔏 helm install: Installs a chart onto Kubernetes cluster.
helm install <release_name> <chart_name>

🔏 helm upgrade: Upgrades a release to a new version of a chart.
helm upgrade <release_name> <chart_name>

🔏 helm rollback: Rolls back a release to a previous revision.
helm rollback <release_name> <revision_number>

🔏 helm list: Lists releases deployed to the cluster.
helm list

🔏 helm status: Displays the status of a release.
helm status <release_name>

🔏 helm uninstall: Uninstalls a release from the cluster.
helm uninstall <release_name>

🔏 helm dependency: Manages chart dependencies.
helm dependency update <chart_directory>
helm dependency build <chart_directory>

🔏 helm package: Packages a chart directory into a chart archive.
helm package <chart_directory>

🔏 helm repo: Manages Helm chart repositories.
helm repo add <repo_name> <repo_url>
helm repo update
helm repo list

🔏 helm template: Renders the Kubernetes manifest templates locally.
helm template <chart_name>